+  · nlinarith only [heq,ha]
+  · norm_num; nlinarith only [heq,ha']
+  · intro e he he'; exact strong_window hs hr.le ha heq he (le_min_iff.mp he').1 (by linarith only [(le_min_iff.mp he').2])
+end DensityStrip
