-      (primaryGenerator (A i) * primaryGenerator (B k) ^ 2 * D l)‖ ^ 2) ≤
-      (Fintype.card c : ℝ) *
-        min ((Fintype.card b : ℝ) * squaredNorm (fun i j => idealKernel (cols j) (A i)))
