-  have hs:N∣∑i,h i*cofactor p i:=Finset.dvd_sum (fun i _=>dvd_mul_of_dvd_left (hh i) _)
-  convert dvd_mul_of_dvd_right hs (l^2*c) using 1 ; simp [finiteCrossNumerator]
