-        (clippedTest W c θ) X Z F≤C*E*(1+‖θ‖)^(2*J):=by
-  obtain ⟨wFresh,af,bf,haf,hab,hc,hsf,hagree⟩:=clipped_fixed_window W lo hi b hlo hb hs
-  refine ⟨wFresh,af,bf,haf,hab,hc,hsf,?_⟩
-  intro J
