-    ∃D:HighData (HeckeZeroSupremum.beta-7/8),∃F:SourceData D,
-    ∃counts:CountParameters F.modulus ⊤ D.t,
-    ∃J:ℝ,0≤J ∧ ∀η:Character,∃C:ℝ,0<C ∧
-      ∀τ:ℝ,0<τ→τ≤1→∀ᶠZ:ℝ in atTop,
-        SourceMomentBound F counts η Z τ (C*(1+Z^(2*τ))^J) (Z^(2*τ))
