-      freq*eisEmbedding (s.upper 0 0)^2*eisEmbedding (((g:SL(2,Eis))*H) 1 1)/
-        eisEmbedding (((g:SL(2,Eis))*H) 1 0)/scale by ring]
-  simp only [AddChar.map_add_eq_mul,mul_div_assoc]
