-    · intro hw
-      refine ⟨M⁻¹ • w,?_,smul_inv_smul M w⟩
-      change proj (M⁻¹ • w)∈S
-      rwa [show proj (M⁻¹ • w)=proj w from integralOrbitProjection_eq _ M⁻¹ w]
