-lemma cubeReducedRemainder_bound_from_height {M:SL(2,Eis)} {p q:Eis}
-    (d:CubeCuspData M p q) (hp:p≠0) (a K:ℝ) (ha:0<a) (hK:0≤K)
-    (hrep:∀j:Fin 3,∀z:ℂ,∀v:ℝ,∀hv:0<v,a/‖eisEmbedding p‖^3≤v→
