-      mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hb _ (mul_pos hc (hr i))) (norm_nonneg _)
-    _=(C*(paperScale*c)^(-(3/2:ℝ)))*(‖a i‖*(r i)^(-(3/2:ℝ))):=by
-      rw [show paperScale*(c*r i)=(paperScale*c)*r i by ring,
-        Real.mul_rpow (mul_pos paperScale_pos hc).le (hr i).le]
-      ring
