-    horizontalWirtingerBar (fun z=>cubicSourceConjugateFunction (upperPoint z v hv)) (g 0 0/g 1 0)=
-      (star (levelTwoComplexCharacter G)*(-1/((g 1 0)^2*(v:ℂ)^2)))*
