-    exact zero_ne_one hn
-  cases inverse
-  · exact (eq_div_iff (star_ne_zero.mpr hG)).mpr
-      (local_sign_conversion p hp hg hchar hprimary).1
-  · exact (eq_div_iff hG).mpr (local_sign_conversion p hp hg hchar hprimary).2
