-    (commonPart_ne_zero I J) (commonPart_ne_zero J I) (commonParts_equal_support I J)
-  unfold CenteredMomentFirstScale.firstNominalScale
-  rw [mappedSubset_product,activeConductor_extracted,hc,hd]
