-      (show u ^ (-σ - 3) / (ν + c / u) ^ 3 = u ^ (-σ) / (ν * u + c) ^ 3 by simpa only [Nat.cast_ofNat] using afe_power_quotient_normalize (σ := σ) hc hν hu 3)]
